58
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:30,760
They're first in line for a twenty-seven point two billion dollars a year pie that didn't exist before they showed up.

59
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:38,920
What they fund: The Global Referendum marketing campaign. Getting two hundred and eighty million people to learn the referendum

60
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:45,340
