107
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:43,800
Politicians pass the treaty. The treaty makes money. Money funds more cures.

108
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:53,780
Cures prove it works. More people demand expansion. This is the first time in your history that "I prefer being alive" has

109
00:11:53,780 --> 00:12:00,560
